#~ msgid "_`Theories or introduction`"
#~ msgstr "理论或简介"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Segmentation in :code:`fcpp` is an "
#~ "iterative image segmentation algorithm that"
#~ " separates foreground from background using"
#~ " user input (e.g., a bounding box)."
#~ " It models color distributions of "
#~ "foreground and background with Gaussian "
#~ "Mixture Models (GMMs), and formulates "
#~ "segmentation as an energy minimization "
#~ "problem on a graph. The algorithm "
#~ "alternates between estimating pixel labels "
#~ "via graph cuts and refining the "
#~ "GMM parameters, converging to an optimal"
#~ " segmentation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":code:`fcpp` "
#~ "中的分割是一种迭代式图像分割算法，它利用用户输入（例如边界框）将前景从背景中分离出来。它使用高斯混合模型 (GMMs) "
#~ "对前景和背景的颜色分布进行建模，并将分割表述为图上的能量最小化问题。该算法在通过图割估计像素标签和细化 GMM "
#~ "参数之间交替进行，最终收敛至最优分割结果。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "E(\\mathbf{L}) = \\sum_p D_p(l_p) + "
#~ "\\lambda \\sum_{p,q \\in \\mathcal{N}} w_{p,q}"
#~ " \\cdot \\delta(l_p \\neq l_q)"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "E(\\mathbf{L}) = \\sum_p D_p(l_p) + "
#~ "\\lambda \\sum_{p,q \\in \\mathcal{N}} w_{p,q}"
#~ " \\cdot \\delta(l_p \\neq l_q)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The total energy is composed of "
#~ "the data term (pixel assignment cost)"
#~ " and the smoothness term (penalty for"
#~ " the difference in labels of adjacent"
#~ " pixels). The unary term :math:`D_p(l_p)"
#~ " = -\\log P(I_p | \\Theta_{l_p})` "
#~ "describes The negative log-likelihood of"
#~ " the color :math:`I_p` of pixel "
#~ ":math:`p` under the foreground or "
#~ "background GMM model :math:`\\Theta_{l_p}`, "
#~ "while :math:`w_{p, q}` is the edge "
#~ "weight between pixel :math:`p` and "
#~ ":math:`q`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "总能量由数据项（像素分配代价）和平滑项（相邻像素标签差异的惩罚）组成。一元项 \\ :math:`D_p(l_p)"
#~ " = -\\log P(I_p | \\Theta_{l_p})`\\ "
#~ "描述了像素 :math:`p` 的颜色 :math:`I_p` 在前台或后台GMM模型"
#~ " :math:`\\Theta_{l_p}` 下的负对数似然，而 :math:`w_{p, q}`"
#~ " 是像素 :math:`p` 和 :math:`q` 之间的边权重。"

